    <string name="speaker_warning_title">⚠️ Internal Speaker Feedback Warning</string>
    <string name="speaker_warning_body">No external P2 Aux cable, USB DAC, or Bluetooth speaker was detected. Amplifying through the phone\'s built-in speaker can cause loud acoustic feedback (microfonia) because the microphone and speaker are right next to each other.\n\nOndaMic will automatically enable the -6 dBFS Safety Limiter and Anti-Feedback Shield for this test.</string>
